{"overview":"در سواحل لاندس هوای غیرعادی گرم است و مروان ۱۷ ساله آخرین روز خود را در کمپینگ می‌گذراند، در حالی که نگران این است که جسدی که روز قبل در ساحل دفن کرده، کشف شود یا نه. مروان همچنین می‌پرسد آیا ممکن است به جولیای جذاب دل بدهد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"It’s unusually hot on the beaches of the Landes, and 17-year-old Marouane is spending his last day at the campground with a nagging fear: will the body he buried on the beach the day before be discovered? Marouane also wonders if he might be falling in love with the charming Giulia.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Stéphane Demoustier"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["FR","BE","IT"],"cast":[{"name":"Hadrien Hussein","role":"Marouane Cherki","photo":"/iY4CSoAY8IgAEhmxjkJR4ZETFKf.jpg"},{"name":"Tristan Richard","role":"Noé","photo":"/713Y3eLcYHKhAJYWifpLytEUXCk.jpg"},{"name":"Martina La Manna","role":"Giulia","photo":"/7wbGQkStzLKRtfpH9GxDvgYE4wJ.jpg"},{"name":"Noé Houssard","role":"Oscar","photo":"/pJGkAo6aTP7cnAj2T796jxu1Cyu.jpg"},{"name":"Zakariya Gouram","role":"Marouane's father","photo":"/25LLQa7drEajgipYDr5P1ADPR5i.jpg"},{"name":"Cécile Ducrocq","role":"Marouane's mother","photo":"/6E0XcytfA9ISFDqjEQhWKnChXpS.jpg"},{"name":"Marguerite Demoustier","role":"Inès Cherki","photo":""},{"name":"Rida Elmanawehly","role":"Sabri Cherki","photo":""},{"name":"Sarah Le Picard","role":"Claire, Oscar's mother","photo":"/6OIETJY9geWiqaS3RPmsRaRfaS1.jpg"},{"name":"Stessie Santoru","role":"Cop","photo":"/uSHRIPS6zP8IzWnXQUDe7hcxLUL.jpg"},{"name":"Doralice Aberrane","role":"Girl yellow shirt","photo":"/2ysgtMcrQKq90xWPSc6cceb5ddr.jpg"},{"name":"Yanis Boulahia","role":"Yanis","photo":""}],"trailer":"","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1492288"}